omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vfQSq2skhfgQ7kNvwHi9-cA&_nc_oc=AdoP5wUtK6_lPIscgUYrzIOvtzfIgAsOa_Yh5tynyYPyxOcLZvBZrOSCmlFq57eKXew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIbn3mpTO5ER9JLCwej64L2uugIdJpmsmyQMxFoFxN5CA&oe=6AA56E34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zaWxbnJt7AQ7kNvwEv7UpC&_nc_oc=AdqAeziZbzjdmmncYB9SJyNK9z4TmX5RsxnyiqDJLm-3XVHXitTIiERkLnP4PVqDzEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJXeYrKoBXOyRsxxTdXM6Okknb0cJsH266daCbEm4jLqg&oe=6AA56F96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FilJhPNIN3sQ7kNvwFpGDhU&_nc_oc=AdpTLLN-hISz-JoiFkth41GbTBzH-5Gc1bV3EFDzWSnwDWgmBEI9c0KAIHjU25aXJGU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLS7WFVgPRkUUzfBA6VFIH3gfu8N6qoI0b2_pNluGssWQ&oe=6AA54C77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://